1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,424
The needle jumps: one point one zero volts.

2
00:00:03,424 --> 00:00:08,007
Zinc atoms lose electrons and dissolve as zinc ions.

3
00:00:08,007 --> 00:00:13,958
Zinc is the anode, where oxidation happens, and it is negative.

4
00:00:13,958 --> 00:00:20,143
The electrons flow through the wire to the copper, where copper ions pick them up and deposit as copper.

5
00:00:20,143 --> 00:00:25,455
Copper is the cathode, where reduction happens, and it is positive.

